<title>SINGAPORE: OSSIA hits high of S$0.80 on debut.</title>
<headline>OSSIA hits high of S$0.80 on debut.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in sporting goods retailer Ossia International hit a high of Singapore 80 cents on its first day of trading on the Singapore stock exchange, against its initial public offer price of 61 cents.  </p>
<p>At 0125 GMT the stock price fell back slightly to 71 cents on volume of 15.19 million units.</p>
<p>Dealers said the move in the price was &quot;not great&quot; compared to other recently listed stocks which had premiums of over 50 percent on their debut. But they were pleased that Ossia had at least traded above its offer price.</p>
<p>Ossia had offered 50 million shares to raise net proceeds of about S$16.3 million.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
